    "detailed_description": "<strong>This is Not 60FPS fighting game !</strong><br>There are a lot of Trash Systems in usual Fighting Game in the world. <br>Do you like keep watching the decreasing health bar without knowing what's going on?<br>Do you like to practice too long and too difficult combos and Mix Ups?<br>Do you like being forced to play unfairly?<br>if Not, welcome to Straight Battler VI !<br>Straight Battler VI needs Only deep mind game lovers !<br><br>Use only 8 keys, And break your rival !<br>Q,W,and E are Jump Attack Keys !<br>A and D is keys of move !<br>S is Guard, Z and X are Attack ! very simple !<br><br>In Straight Battler VI, very simple operations make exciting games !<br>And we prepared several mode to play !<br><br>In Tutorial mode, you can learn how to fight !<br>In  CPU mode, CPU is waiting for you to battle !<br>In Offline mode, you can compete with your friend in local !<br>In Online mode, there are Room Match and Rank Match.<br>In Room Match, you can create and join online room to play with your friend !<br>In Rank Match, games give you Points if you win !<br>Go Rank Match and compete for Points with players in around the world !",
